<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h2>
<pre>{{Languages|PageName}}
</pre>
<p><b>PageName</b>
</p><p>The PageName parameter is the name of the original English page to display language links for. 
</p><p>This parameter can be omitted on the original English page but, because subpages are not active for all namespaces, must be included on the translated page.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Example">Example</span></h2>
<p>The following example represent the text needed to add the language bar to a) this page and b) a translated version of this page:
</p>
<pre> a) {{Languages}}
 b) {{Languages|Template:Languages}}
</pre>
